{"id": "69863", "title": "误惹首长大人", "author": "浮生伊始", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 17, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69863.htm", "intro": "在京城里，他的名字可是响当当的，战绩斐然，家世显赫。\r\n他是谁？赫赫有名的年轻大校，高官圏里头的冷面首长。\r\n但在可兰的眼里，他只是一位，相错亲的……无赖！\r\n******\r\n她是梁氏企业总经理林启业的大女儿，正牌合法，受法律保护。\r\n母亲嫁给父亲的时候，才十九岁。\r\n甜蜜过，爱过，却依旧敌不过金钱的诱惑。\r\n父亲做了凤凰男。\r\n抛妻弃女，病痛不管，死了正合意。\r\n当她走投无路，相亲还相错了对像时。\r\n“相错亲的事，很抱歉，在没谅成错误之前，我希望顾先生能够在离婚协议上签字。”她侃侃而道，似乎无足轻重。\r\n他轻笑：“如果生米煮成熟饭呢？”", "base": "files/article/html/69/69863", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "10712584.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10712585.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "10712586.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "10712587.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10712588.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10712589.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "10712590.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "10712591.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-50", "file": "10712592.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-59", "file": "10712593.html", "available": false}, {"title": "60-70", "file": "10712594.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-80", "file": "10712595.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81-90", "file": "10712596.html", "available": false}, {"title": "91-96", "file": "10712597.html", "available": false}, {"title": "97-102", "file": "10712598.html", "available": false}, {"title": "103-108", "file": "10712599.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "10712600.html", "available": false}]}